        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="content-subtitle accent">02 [//] Goal</div>
                <div class="copy">
                    <h2>Engineering a Digital Authority</h2>
                    <p>The goal was to transform the website from a static brochure into a powerful lead-generation tool. Our strategy focused on: <br><br>
