                        </ul> 
                        <br><br>
                        Covering every step of the process: <strong><i>[userflow, prototyping, reviews, Testing of form process]</i></strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section> -->

    <section class="section section--alt">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">02 [//] Goal</div>
                    <h2>Engineering a Digital Authority</h2>
                    <p>The goal was to transform the website from a static brochure into a powerful lead-generation tool. Our strategy focused on: <br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Modernization</strong>: Overhauling the visual identity to align with international engineering standards.</li>
                            <li><strong>Service Hierarchy</strong>: Organizing complex solutions (electrical, mechanical, metalworking) into an easy-to-navigate architecture.</li>
                             <li><strong>Trust Building</strong>: Highlighting 25 years of experience through social proof and technical certifications to attract B2B clients.</li>
                        </ul> 
                        <br><br>
                        Covering every step of the process: <strong><i>[userflow, prototyping, reviews, Testing of form process]</i></strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="../images/process-inmape-1.avif" alt="Image of the web design process - 1">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">03 [//] onboarding</div>
                    <h2>Intuitive Service Discovery</h2>
                    <p>We designed a navigation flow that prioritizes <strong><i>"Ease of Access."</i></strong> Understanding that industrial clients often look for specific technical solutions, we implemented:<br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Categorized Navigation:</strong>: A streamlined menu that separates maintenance types (preventive, predictive, corrective) for instant identification.</li>
                            <li><strong>Smart Contact Points</strong>: Strategically placed CTA (Call to Action) buttons that allow potential clients to request quotes or technical visits with minimal clicks.</li>
                        </ul>             
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="../images/Portada_Inmape.avif" alt="Image of the web design implementation on webflow. Viewing 2 screens: Home and About">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

